From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:45:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: give HTTP metrics listener startup a structured
 event

Preserve the existing Info message and fixed /metrics handler, registry,
operator listener, ACL/authentication and metric names. Expose its existing
HTTP path separately from filesystem paths; no collection behavior changes.
Extend the owned-node networking fixture with a real authorized GET /metrics,
HTTP status/content-type/Prometheus checks and exact typed startup text.

Scripted diff (ast-grep-py 0.51.0):
  /private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/http-metrics-lifecycle.json --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-cleanup/http-metrics307-conversion.json --apply
  git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/httpmetrics.cpp

Source-only checkpoint pending combined native gate. Shared eCash owner;
no metrics or network policy change. Preserve immutable native294 evidence.

diff --git a/contrib/logging/conversion/rules/http-metrics-lifecycle.json b/contrib/logging/conversion/rules/http-metrics-lifecycle.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..22e600064d633f8ddad055488c45b7f922862eb2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/contrib/logging/conversion/rules/http-metrics-lifecycle.json
@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+{
+  "schema": 1,
+  "batch": "http-metrics-lifecycle",
+  "status": "SOURCE_APPLIED_PENDING_NATIVE_GATE",
+  "files": [
+    {
+      "path": "src/httpmetrics.cpp",
+      "rules": [
+        {
+          "id": "http_metrics_serving",
+          "old": "LogPrintf(\"Serving metrics at /metrics on the RPC listeners\\n\")",
+          "replacement": "LogInfoEvent(BCLog::ALL, \"http_metrics_serving\", \"Serving metrics at /metrics on the RPC listeners\").Field(BCLog::LogField::HttpPath, BCLog::LogStatic(\"/metrics\"))",
+          "count": 1,
+          "reviewed_input": {
+            "macro": "LogPrintf",
+            "format": "Serving metrics at /metrics on the RPC listeners\n",
+            "specifiers": [],
+            "arguments": []
+          },
+          "review_note": "Preserve Info, exact statictext, metrics registry/handler/ACL/authentication/listener behavior. Existing fixed public HTTP path is queryable, not a filesystem file.path. No collection or metric-name changes."
+        }
+      ]
+    }
+  ]
+}
diff --git a/src/httpmetrics.cpp b/src/httpmetrics.cpp
index 7217bd2c79655e539958129dde9d73008553c1d2..535b7077e11897d7f2c534c765f47a94e6e73dd5 100644
--- a/src/httpmetrics.cpp
+++ b/src/httpmetrics.cpp
@@ -43,7 +43,9 @@ util::Result<void> StartHTTPMetrics(
     node::NodeMetrics &m{**started};
     m.process_start_time.Set(double(GetStartupTime()));
     RegisterHTTPHandler("/metrics", true, HTTPReqMetrics);
-    LogPrintf("Serving metrics at /metrics on the RPC listeners\n");
+    LogInfoEvent(BCLog::ALL, "http_metrics_serving",
+                 "Serving metrics at /metrics on the RPC listeners")
+        .Field(BCLog::LogField::HttpPath, BCLog::LogStatic("/metrics"));
     return {};
 }
 
